															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5950867); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605795107" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5950867); return false;" >KaraKatt</a></span> <span class="odate time_1588633467 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">04 May 2020 23:04</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4629722">
									

<p>Hello hello!</p>
<p>I’m Kara from the Site Crit team!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Ze&nbsp;Crit&nbsp;O’&nbsp;Doom</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>- “The following day, all nine resident Sumatran orangutans spontaneously ignited during viewing hours.” I would like more detail to what they did after this. Did the people freak out?</p>
<p>- “Perdition Committee” Is this a Foundation thing? I would assume not, but I’m still a bit confused on that. What does the Perdition Committee do? I would suggest using a footnote to add that.</p>
<p>- In the addendum orangutan is spelled wrong.</p>
<p>Final thoughts:</p>
<p>This was a fun read. It opens a lot of doors for some tales and other things to go along with it, and I tend to like SCPs like that. I can’t help but feel there's something missing, and I can’t put my finger on it. I don’t think it's in the end since that part gives me a more “To be continued” feeling, which isn’t the issue.</p>
<p>As a sidebar on the music, I think it was ok. The melody got extremely repetitive and sometimes it can become stale to the listener. I didn’t exactly like the ending, but I think that's just because I’m a music snob. Other than that, great job on the composition part.</p>
<p>Overall, great job! I really liked this and it kept my attention to the end. I hope to see more from you in the future!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
